    "bbox": [
      87.69,
      357.08,
      500.93,
      369.26
    ],
    "text": "THE NATIONAL MEDICINES REGULATORY AUTHORITY ACT, No. 5 OF 2015",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      382.33,
      539.91,
      405.4
    ],
    "text": "REGULATIONS made by the Minister of Health, Nutrition and Indigenous Medicine under Section 142 read together withSection 118 of the National Medicines Regulatory Authority Act, No. 5 of 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      378.81,
      418.33,
      510.82,
      441.4
    ],
    "text": "Dr. RAJITHA SENARATNE (M.P.),Minister of Health, Nutrition and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      394.65,
      442.33,
      495.1,
      453.4
    ],
    "text": "Indigenous Medicine.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      48.81,
      466.33,
      124.65,
      489.4
    ],
    "text": "Colombo,21st October, 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      265.05,
      499.28,
      323.49,
      511.46
    ],
    "text": "Regulations",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      81.09,
      524.53,
      539.89,
      535.6
    ],
    "text": "1. These regulations may be cited as the National Medicines Regulatory Authority (Ceiling on Prices) Regulations,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      93.81,
      536.53,
      153.09,
      547.6
    ],
    "text": "No. 2 of 2016.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      81.09,
      560.53,
      539.91,
      571.6
    ],
    "text": "2. There shall be a ceiling on prices of the drug-formulations set out in the Schedule hereto (hereinafter referred to",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      93.81,
      572.53,
      539.96,
      595.6
    ],
    "text": "as \u201cscheduled drugs\u201d) which shall come into operation on the date of publication of these regulations in theGazette Extraordinary (hereinafter referred to as the \u201crelevant date\u201d).",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      81.09,
      608.53,
      539.94,
      619.6
    ],
    "text": "3. The ceiling on prices of the scheduled drugs shall apply to and in respect of all branded and generic versions of",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      93.81,
      620.53,
      190.53,
      631.6
    ],
    "text": "such drug-formulations.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      81.09,
      644.53,
      539.94,
      655.6
    ],
    "text": "4. On and after the relevant date, no manufacturer, importer, trader and pharmacist shall sell any scheduled drug set",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      93.81,
      656.53,
      539.95,
      679.6
    ],
    "text": "out in Column II of the Schedule hereto, above the Maximum Retail Price (MRP) stipulated in the correspondingentry in Column V thereof.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      81.09,
      690.49,
      539.94,
      701.56
    ],
    "text": "5. A manufacturer, importer, trader or pharmacist who currently sells a scheduled drug at a price less than the MRP",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      93.81,
      702.49,
      471.87,
      713.56
    ],
    "text": "stipulated in the Schedule is required to maintain the existing price without any price increase.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      47.85,
      747.35,
      315.57,
      756.21
    ],
    "text": "This Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      55.15,
      72.37,
      529.6,
      93.33
    ],
    "text": "I fldgi ( ^I& fPoh - YS% ,xld m%cd;dka;s%l iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h - 2016'10'21PART I : SEC. (I) - GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA - 21.10.20162A",
    "fonts": [
      "FMAbabld,Bold",
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.599999904632568,
      8.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      87.43,
      101.17,
      547.21,
      112.24
    ],
    "text": "6. The relevant MRP as set out in the Schedule hereto or the current retail price, whichever is less, of each unit of",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      100.15,
      113.17,
      547.2,
      148.24
    ],
    "text": "item in the stock of scheduled drugs manufactured or available in the market or pharmacy for sale on the relevantdate shall be printed or marked in their respective commercial package or label as expeditiously as practicable, sohowever, before the expiry of a period of forty-five days from the relevant date.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      87.43,
      161.17,
      547.17,
      172.24
    ],
    "text": "7. Notwithstanding the provisions of regulation 6 above, the MRP of each unit shall be as set out in the Schedule on",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      100.15,
      173.17,
      547.22,
      196.24
    ],
    "text": "and after the relevant date. The MRP set out in the Schedule shall continue to be valid and effectual for a periodof two years from the relevant date unless earlier revised.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      87.43,
      209.17,
      547.15,
      220.24
    ],
    "text": "8. The implementation of these regulations shall be the responsibility of the National Medicines Regulatory Authority,",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      100.15,
      221.17,
      485.68,
      232.24
    ],
    "text": "the Ministry of Health, Nutrition and Indigenous Medicine and the Consumer Affairs Authority.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      87.43,
      245.17,
      547.24,
      256.24
    ],
    "text": "9. Any manufacturer, importer, trader or pharmacist who contravenes the provisions of these regulations commits",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      100.15,
      257.17,
      547.16,
      280.24
    ],
    "text": "an offence and shall be triable under Section 132 of the National Medicines Regulatory Authority Act, No.5 of2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      82.87,
      290.17,
      547.23,
      301.24
    ],
    "text": "10. It shall be the duty of every manufacturer, trader, importer and pharmacist to display at every retail outlet the MRP",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      100.15,
      302.17,
      318.47,
      313.24
    ],
    "text": "of the scheduled drugs set out in the Schedule hereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      277.51,
      326.17,
      324.79,
      337.24
    ],
